      "issues": [
        "- In the “एक झटका जो सोचने पर मजबूर कर दे” section, the example for 2:48 claims the smaller angle is 132°, but the correct angle is 156° (|30×2 – 5.5×48| = 204°, 360°–204° = 156°).",
        "- In the “सारांश तालिका”, the formula for “सुइयों के बीच कोण” is written as “θ = 30H – 5.5M” without absolute value, which can give negative results; it should be “θ = |30H – 5.5M|”."
      ],
